WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.503 --> 00:00:01.321
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

2
00:00:07.244 --> 00:00:12.077
<v><b>Max:</b></v> Hey, Lucy. I’m trying to study, and you’re making an awful noise.

3
00:00:12.139 --> 00:00:19.572
<v><b>Lucy:</b></v> It isn’t noise, it’s Beethoven. I’m practising — I have a school concert tomorrow.

4
00:00:19.813 --> 00:00:21.800
You can study downstairs.

5
00:00:21.815 --> 00:00:24.866
<v><b>Max:</b></v> I can’t, Jake’s playing a video game.

6
00:00:24.976 --> 00:00:26.496
<v><b>Lucy:</b></v> What about the kitchen?

7
00:00:26.559 --> 00:00:30.359
<v><b>Max:</b></v> No, Dad’s cooking dinner, and he’s listening to the football.

8
00:00:30.527 --> 00:00:32.907
It’s impossible to work in this house!

9
00:00:40.811 --> 00:00:41.723
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

10
00:00:42.562 --> 00:00:44.973
<v><b>Paul:</b></v> Isabel! Can you come here?

11
00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:48.401
<v><b>Isabel:</b></v> What’s the matter?

12
00:00:48.516 --> 00:00:50.382
<v><b>Paul:</b></v> What’s happening next door?

13
00:00:50.518 --> 00:00:53.705
Why’s their dog barking? I can’t hear the radio.

14
00:00:54.083 --> 00:00:57.081
<v><b>Isabel:</b></v> They’re having a party in the garden.

15
00:00:58.108 --> 00:01:01.295
<v><b>Paul:</b></v> Not again! Can you go and talk to them?

16
00:01:02.176 --> 00:01:07.501
<v><b>Isabel:</b></v> Yes, good idea. It’s their second party in three weeks!